{"id":"n24574-2-7","stage":3,"title":"일찍이 · 早已","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24574-2-7-1","ko":"공연은 어땠어요?","zh":"演出怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공연은","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연은","audio":"/audio/592aa88f99ff629256aa.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어요","audio":"/audio/93cb69622b41f67a2913.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7c393784a72549766a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24574-2-7-2","ko":"정말 좋았어요. 일찍이 느껴 보지 못한 감동이었어요.","zh":"非常好。那是一种我以前从未体验过的感动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았어요.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았어요","audio":"/audio/00fd50c82fea427bab50.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍이","meaning":"曾经、以前（与否定合用：以往从未）","explanation":"일찍이 的本关义项韩文定义是以前、此前；与 느껴 보지 못한 合用表示以往从未感受过，不能只按早已理解为过去已经做过。","readings":[{"term":"일찍이","audio":"/audio/57b3d020c79c3a2946db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24574","senseId":"2","lemma":"일찍이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍이","audio":"/audio/57b3d020c79c3a2946db.mp3"}},{"text":"느껴","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느껴","audio":"/audio/ada7cc18f1cc736374f4.mp3"}},{"text":"보지","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보지","audio":"/audio/8281a3bf56cc54d875da.mp3"}},{"text":"못한","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못한","audio":"/audio/ef515538c3621ef7d6ed.mp3"}},{"text":"감동이었어요.","meaning":"感动，打动","explanation":"감동：感动，打动；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"감동","audio":"/audio/2a1ffce0bf4b418393ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70709","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감동이었어요","audio":"/audio/0dbb707c0e9e83234d8a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"57b3d020c79c3a29","term":"일찍이","zh":"以前、此前","audio":"/audio/57b3d020c79c3a2946db.mp3","entryId":"24574","definition":"以前、此前","pronunciation":["일찌기"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"2a1ffce0bf4b4183","term":"감동","zh":"感动，打动","audio":"/audio/2a1ffce0bf4b418393ca.mp3","entryId":"70709","definition":"有强烈感受后心动。","pronunciation":["감ː동"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a94800aae3df5f68457.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24574","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["非常好。那是一种我以前从未体验过的感动。","演出怎么样？","我常看的那个节目好像要停播了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["演出怎么样？","我常看的那个节目好像要停播了。","非常好。那是一种我以前从未体验过的感动。"],"answer":2}]}
